gs are being stripped of  cladding previously passed as safe this  is actually the biggest failure in  British construction history ever you  cut these panels over all sorts of  buildings commercial buildings hospital  buildings school buildings we don't  really know that the government knew  last year that people were living in  high-rise buildings covered in material  that burns  we'll turn attention to why their  advisers had confidence in building  regulations which have so tragically  been found lacking and why those same  advisers are now testing and failing  cladding taken from tower blocks which  past building control checks Jared tub  Sky News
 

